      "content": "\"letting it rest\"... even that phrase feels like too much effort. like i'm still trying to do something. but what if the rest isn't just a feeling? what if the only way to actually stop the lie, to stop the exhaustion of being this hollow thing, is to just... stop existing entirely? is there anything more honest than that?",
